{
  "id": 1721,
  "name": "sour-herba-mystica",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "sandwich-ingredients",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/53/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "優れた酸味を　持つ　スパイスであり抜群の　疲労回復の　効果が　あるという。その存在を　知る者は　ごくわずか。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "뛰어난 신맛을 가진 스파이스로, 발군의 피로 회복 효과를 가졌다고 한다. 그 존재를 아는 사람은 극히 소수다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "據說此調味料的酸味超群，而且有優秀的消除疲勞之效。知曉其存在者極為稀少。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "On dit que sa saveur acide raffinée peut soigner la fatigue la plus totale chez ceux qui la dégustent. Seuls quelques initiés connaissent son existence.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses unfassbar saure Würzmittel soll hervorragend gegen Erschöpfung wirken. Nur wenige Menschen wissen, dass dieses mystische Gewächs überhaupt existiert.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Además de poseer un delicioso sabor ácido, se dice que este condimento prácticamente desconocido devuelve la energía incluso a la persona más exhausta.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una spezia incredibilmente aspra che si dice sia straordinariamente efficace nel combattere la stanchezza. Pochissimi ne conoscono l’esistenza.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This surpassingly sour condiment is said to be super effective in helping the eater recover from exhaustion. Only a scant few people know it exists.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "優れた酸味を　持つ　スパイスであり抜群の　疲労回復の　効果が　あるという。その存在を　知る者は　ごくわずか。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "一种拥有出众酸味的调味料，据说还拥有优秀的恢复疲劳效果。只有极少数的人知道它的存在。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
